%% DM26-0670

%% A publish, online, as built (2026-11-04, docs/architecture/cassini-client-reliability.md "Step 2, as built", and cassini-backpressure.md). What the broker does
%% with it is broker/client_publish, and what it does when it has no room is broker/backpressure_admission.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Domain actor
    participant C as Credit
    participant F as Facade (outbox, buffer)
    participant T as Transport
    participant B as Broker

    alt publish_when_ready
        D->>C: wait for room in the outbox, then take it
    else publish
        D->>C: take room: outbox, then the buffer if it asks to Queue
        alt no room anywhere
            C-->>D: BufferFull, or Busy (Fail), or counted and gone (Drop)
        end
    end
    D->>F: PublishWith(topic, payload, slot)
    alt it took room in the outbox
        F->>F: assign (epoch, seq), and keep it in the outbox
        F->>T: Transmit(topic, id), at once if a transport is registered
        T->>B: PublishRequest(epoch, seq)
    else it took room in the buffer
        F->>F: wait in order, and go to the outbox as room is made
    end

    alt accepted
        B-->>T: PublishRequestAck(topic, epoch, seq), for this message only
        T-->>F: Acknowledged(id)
        F->>F: settle exactly that entry, then promote what waits in the buffer
        F->>C: room made, which wakes a waiting caller
        T-->>D: ClientEvent::PublishAcknowledged(topic, id)
    else refused (policy)
        B-->>T: PublishResponse(Err, Denied, origin)
        T-->>F: Refused(id)
        F->>F: settle it: it is not sent again
        T-->>D: ClientEvent::PublishRefused(topic, reason)
    else refused for now
        B-->>T: PublishResponse(Err, Unavailable, origin)
        T-->>F: Deferred(id)
        F->>F: kept, with one timer: a wait doubling from 1 s to 30 s
        F->>T: Transmit(topic, id), the same number, when it fires
    end
    Note over F,B: A message leaves the outbox only when the broker answers that exact message. Acks come back in any<br/>order, since different topic actors answer. Writing to the socket proves nothing, and silence is not resent:<br/>a topic holding a publish back leaves it unacknowledged on purpose.
